              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "about-the-conference-b1-s1",
              "text": "This page covers the WOSA Conference held alongside the 2027 National Show, what the conference is, who it is for, and how it fits into the wider programme.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "about-the-conference-b2",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "about-the-conference-b2-s1",
              "text": "The WOSA Conference is organised in partnership with Wild Orchids of Southern Africa and runs as its own dedicated strand of the Show, distinct from the SAOC Symposium.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
