              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "about-wosa-b1-s1",
              "text": "Wild Orchids of Southern Africa (WOSA) is the Council's partner organisation for matters relating to orchids growing outside cultivation.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "about-wosa-b2",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "about-wosa-b2-s1",
              "text": "WOSA's own website carries their identification, ecological and conservation content directly, which sits outside what this site covers.",
              "marks": []
            }
